{
    "patcher": {
        "fileversion": 1,
        "appversion": {
            "major": 9,
            "minor": 1,
            "revision": 4,
            "architecture": "x64",
            "modernui": 1
        },
        "classnamespace": "box",
        "rect": [ 85.0, 104.0, 1000.0, 640.0 ],
        "description": "_br.comp.example.1.2 -- Created by Brian Riordan, guaguanco127@gmail.com -- https://github.com/guaguanco127/ -- Credits: soft-knee gain computer and dB-domain gain smoothing from D. Giannoulis, M. Massberg and J. D. Reiss, \"Digital Dynamic Range Compressor Design -- A Tutorial and Analysis\", Journal of the Audio Engineering Society 60(6), 2012.",
        "showontab": 1,
        "boxes": [
            {
                "box": {
                    "fontname": "Arial",
                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                    "id": "obj-signature",
                    "linecount": 4,
                    "maxclass": "comment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 620.0, 15.0, 662.0, 60.0 ],
                    "text": "_br.comp.example.1.2 -- Created by Brian Riordan, guaguanco127@gmail.com\nhttps://github.com/guaguanco127/\nCredits: soft-knee gain computer and dB-domain gain smoothing from D. Giannoulis, M. Massberg and J. D. Reiss, \"Digital Dynamic Range Compressor Design -- A Tutorial and Analysis\", Journal of the Audio Engineering Society 60(6), 2012."
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "fontname": "Arial",
                    "fontsize": 24.0,
                    "id": "obj-2",
                    "maxclass": "comment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 15.0, 15.0, 300.0, 33.0 ],
                    "text": "br.comp"
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "fontname": "Arial",
                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                    "id": "obj-3",
                    "linecount": 2,
                    "maxclass": "comment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 15.0, 57.0, 560.0, 33.0 ],
                    "text": "A linked stereo compressor in gen~ whose controls mean what their units say: Threshold and Knee in dB, Ratio as N:1, Attack and Release in ms (time to 63% of the move)."
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "fontname": "Arial",
                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                    "id": "obj-4",
                    "linecount": 6,
                    "maxclass": "comment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 15.0, 115.0, 524.0, 87.0 ],
                    "text": "Two files, same inlets in the same order. br.comp.ui.1.2 has dials, a GR meter and a State outlet: load it in a [bpatcher]. br.comp.1.2 is the plain object with no dials: its control inlets go straight into gen~, so they take numbers or signals (see the plain object tab). Inlets: L, R, then one per control in panel order (Threshold, Ratio, Attack, Release, Knee, Makeup, Auto Makeup, Dry/Wet, Detect, Sidechain), then Sidechain L, Sidechain R. Hover any inlet or outlet for its range and default."
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "fontname": "Arial",
                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                    "id": "obj-5",
                    "linecount": 2,
                    "maxclass": "comment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 15.0, 213.0, 722.0, 33.0 ],
                    "text": "Outlets: L, R, the gain reduction in dB as a signal (0 = none), and on the .ui, State last: the settings as named messages the moment a control changes (see the State outlet tab). Every control glides 10 ms inside, so moves never click. Silent input costs almost no CPU."
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "fontname": "Arial",
                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                    "id": "obj-6",
                    "linecount": 5,
                    "maxclass": "comment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 15.0, 274.0, 387.0, 74.0 ],
                    "text": "Tabs:\n  compress: pick a source and shape it\n  sidechain: a drone ducked by a drum loop through the sidechain inlets\n  plain object: br.comp.1.2 with number boxes and an LFO on Dry/Wet\n  State outlet: the compress tab's settings, read by name"
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "fontname": "Arial",
                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                    "id": "obj-7",
                    "maxclass": "comment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 15.0, 362.0, 560.0, 20.0 ],
                    "text": "Outputs start muted at -70 dB: turn on audio, then raise the slider slowly."
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "fontname": "Arial",
                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                    "id": "obj-8",
                    "maxclass": "comment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 15.0, 387.0, 300.0, 20.0 ],
                    "text": "By Brian Riordan. github.com/guaguanco127"
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "fontname": "Arial",
                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                    "id": "obj-9",
                    "maxclass": "newobj",
                    "numinlets": 0,
                    "numoutlets": 1,
                    "outlettype": [ "" ],
                    "patcher": {
                        "fileversion": 1,
                        "appversion": {
                            "major": 9,
                            "minor": 1,
                            "revision": 4,
                            "architecture": "x64",
                            "modernui": 1
                        },
                        "classnamespace": "box",
                        "rect": [ 0.0, 26.0, 1000.0, 614.0 ],
                        "showontab": 1,
                        "boxes": [
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "fontname": "Arial",
                                    "fontsize": 18.0,
                                    "id": "obj-1",
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 15.0, 15.0, 150.0, 27.0 ],
                                    "text": "compress"
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "fontname": "Arial",
                                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                                    "id": "obj-2",
                                    "linecount": 2,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 15.0, 51.0, 290.0, 33.0 ],
                                    "text": "Pick a source and turn the controls. The GR meter shows how far the comp turns the sound down."
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "fontname": "Arial",
                                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                                    "id": "obj-3",
                                    "linecount": 3,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 15.0, 110.0, 290.0, 47.0 ],
                                    "text": "Start: Threshold until GR moves on the loud parts, then Ratio for how hard. Makeup brings the level back (or Auto)."
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "fontname": "Arial",
                                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                                    "id": "obj-4",
                                    "linecount": 3,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 15.0, 169.0, 290.0, 47.0 ],
                                    "text": "Attack: short catches the front of a hit, long lets it through (punch). Release: short = pumping, long = smooth."
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "fontname": "Arial",
                                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                                    "id": "obj-5",
                                    "linecount": 2,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 15.0, 228.0, 290.0, 33.0 ],
                                    "text": "Detect: 0 % = peak (reacts to transients), 100 % = RMS (reacts to loudness, gentler on voice)."
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "fontname": "Arial",
                                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                                    "id": "obj-6",
                                    "linecount": 3,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 15.0, 287.0, 290.0, 47.0 ],
                                    "text": "Dry/Wet below 100 % = parallel compression: the dry hits stay, the squashed copy fills in. Dry/Wet at 0 % = bypass, to compare."
                                }
                            },
