                                    "text": "br.comp.1.2 is the compressor with no dials: every control inlet goes straight into gen~, so numbers OR signals work. Here number boxes set Threshold, Ratio, Attack, Release and Makeup, and a slow LFO (a signal) swells Dry/Wet between the dry loop and the squashed copy."
